<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
  .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .line-item-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .label-col { width: 150px; font-weight: bold; }
  .input-col { flex-grow: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .signature-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <span style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold;">CSUN</span><br>
    <span style="font-size: 12px;">CALIFORNIA</span><br>
    <span style="font-size: 12px;">STATE UNIVERSITY</span><br>
    <span style="font-size: 12px;">NORTHRIDGE</span>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 10px;">
    <span style="font-weight: bold;">University Cash Services</span>
  </div>

  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">UNDELIVERED PAY WARRANTS</h1>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Bayramian Hall, Room 100R</p>
    <p>Phone: (818) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
    <p>Mail Code: <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <p>When the Department Designated Representative (DDR) is unable to deliver live pay warrants to an employee within <span data-field="business_days">{{ business_days }}</span> business days of distribution, the warrants must be returned to University Cash Services along with this form.</p>
  <p>For more information, please refer to section II, item #8 of the <span data-field="procedure_link">{{ procedure_link }}</span>.</p>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Department Name: _________________________</p>
    <p>Dept ID(s): _________________________</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Repetitive Form Fields -->
  {% for i in range(10) %}
  <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 5px;">
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        Name: _________________________
        <div style="font-size: 10px; margin-top: 2px;">Last Name, First, Middle Initial</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        Empl ID: _________________________
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        Warrant#: _________________________
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        Issue Date: _________________________
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <!-- Signature Section -->
  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      Prepared by: _________________________<br>
      <div style="font-size: 10px;">Signature: _________________________</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      Date: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div>
      Supervisor: _________________________<br>
      <div style="font-size: 10px;">Signature: _________________________</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      Date: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    UCS Received by: _________________________<br>
    <div style="font-size: 10px;">Signature: _________________________</div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10px;">Date: _________________________</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px; text-align: center; font-size: 10px;">
    ATTACHMENT C
    <div style="float: right;">REV: 09-11-19</div>
  </div>
</div>